// 原GD六个真实读边界对照；额外小型投影夹具只测分页/隐藏/缺文本/粮批，不作为合法新世界发布。
#include "resident/kernel/world_codec.hpp"
#include "resident/views/journey_interaction.hpp"
#include "resident/views/common_presentation.hpp"
#include <cassert>
#include <fstream>
#include <iostream>
using namespace hanmo::resident;
namespace {
// 读取原始证据和生产结果失败时，保留精确首错供定位，不伪装成空视图。
BoundaryValue read_file(const std::string& path){std::ifstream f(path);assert(f.good());std::string text((std::istreambuf_iterator<char>(f)),{});auto value=parse_boundary_json(text);assert(value.ok);return std::move(value.value);}
template<class T>T checked(Outcome<T> value){if(!value.ok){std::cerr<<value.error.original.code<<":"<<value.error.original.path<<"\n";std::abort();}return std::move(value.value);}
void require(Status value){if(!value.ok){std::cerr<<value.error.original.code<<":"<<value.error.original.path<<"\n";std::abort();}}
void exact(const BoundaryValue& a,const BoundaryValue& b){auto diff=compare_boundary(a,b);if(!diff.exact()){auto failure=diff.value_difference?diff.value_difference:diff.order_difference;std::cerr<<failure->path<<":"<<failure->reason<<"\n";std::abort();}}
StableId string(const BoundaryValue& v,const StableId& key){return boundary::get_string(v,key,"oracle");}
Integer integer(const BoundaryValue& v,const StableId& key){return boundary::get_int(v,key,"oracle");}
// 包装真实A表现端口，只记录选择范围；全部值和错误仍来自生产实现。
class ObservedPresentation final:public PresentationRead {
public:
    explicit ObservedPresentation(const CommonPresentation& source):source_(source){}
    Outcome<std::string> display_name(const StableId& id)const override{names.push_back(id);return source_.display_name(id);}
    Outcome<std::string> text(const StableId& key)const override{texts.push_back(key);return source_.text(key);}
    mutable std::vector<StableId> names,texts;
private:const CommonPresentation& source_;
};
// 不把缺字段归一化成空字段；原scene和say/choice结构在typed层分别检查。
void dialogue_matches(const JourneyDialogueView& view,const BoundaryValue& expected){assert(view.phase==string(expected,"phase"));assert(bool(view.context)==bool(expected.find("context")));assert(bool(view.node_id)==bool(expected.find("node_id")));assert(bool(view.last_outcome)==bool(expected.find("last_outcome")));assert(bool(view.speaker)==bool(expected.find("speaker")));assert(bool(view.text)==bool(expected.find("text")));assert(view.has_options==bool(expected.find("options")));assert(!view.command&&!view.pending_action_id);if(view.context){auto& e=*expected.find("context");assert(view.context->place_id==string(e,"place_id")&&view.context->provider_actor_id==string(e,"provider_actor_id")&&view.context->role_id==string(e,"role_id"));assert(bool(view.context->kind)==bool(e.find("kind")));if(view.context->kind)assert(*view.context->kind==string(e,"kind"));assert(bool(view.context->encounter_id)==bool(e.find("encounter_id")));if(view.context->encounter_id)assert(*view.context->encounter_id==string(e,"encounter_id"));}if(view.node_id)assert(*view.node_id==string(expected,"node_id"));if(view.speaker)assert(*view.speaker==string(expected,"speaker"));if(view.text)assert(*view.text==string(expected,"text"));if(view.last_outcome)assert(!view.last_outcome->present&&expected.find("last_outcome")->as<BoundaryValue::Dict>()->empty());if(view.has_options){auto& rows=*expected.find("options")->as<BoundaryValue::Array>();assert(view.cursor==0&&!view.next_cursor&&view.total_rows==static_cast<Integer>(rows.size())&&view.options.size()==rows.size());for(std::size_t i=0;i<rows.size();++i)assert(view.options[i].id==string(rows[i],"id")&&view.options[i].text==string(rows[i],"text"));}}
// 控制的作者选项夹具验证条件先于文本读取，分页保可见原序，所有查询仍读同一真实候选。
void choice_edges(WorldBundle& w,const CommonPresentation& presentation){auto catalog=*w.catalog->interaction;auto& session=w.interaction.interactions.front();DialogueNode* node=nullptr;for(auto& d:catalog.dialogues)if(d.id==session.dialogue_id)for(auto& n:d.nodes)if(n.id==session.node_id)node=&n;assert(node&&!node->options.empty());auto original=node->options.front();node->options.clear();for(Integer i=0;i<70;++i){auto option=original;option.id="visible:"+std::to_string(i);option.conditions.clear();node->options.push_back(option);}auto hidden=original;hidden.id="secret";hidden.text_key="not.selected.missing";hidden.conditions.clear();Condition no;no.kind=Condition::Kind::flag;no.flag=w.interaction.flags.front().id;no.equals=!w.interaction.flags.front().value;hidden.conditions.push_back(no);node->options.insert(node->options.begin()+3,hidden);auto access=w.services.interaction_access();auto player=w.common.state().metadata.player_actor_id;ObservedPresentation observed(presentation);auto first=checked(query_interaction_view(w.common,w.interaction,catalog,access,observed,player));assert(first.total_rows==70&&first.options.size()==64&&first.next_cursor==64);for(Integer i=0;i<64;++i)assert(first.options[i].id=="visible:"+std::to_string(i));auto second=checked(query_interaction_view(w.common,w.interaction,catalog,access,observed,player,64));assert(second.options.size()==6&&!second.next_cursor);for(Integer i=0;i<6;++i)assert(second.options[i].id=="visible:"+std::to_string(i+64));for(auto& key:observed.texts)assert(key!="not.selected.missing");auto bad=query_interaction_view(w.common,w.interaction,catalog,access,presentation,player,71);assert(!bad.ok&&bad.error.original.code=="InvalidJourneyCursor");assert(!query_interaction_view(w.common,w.interaction,catalog,access,presentation,player,-1).ok);auto large_catalog=*w.catalog->common;large_catalog.texts.set(node->text_key,std::string(4097,'x'));CommonPresentation large(w.common.state(),large_catalog);bad=query_interaction_view(w.common,w.interaction,catalog,access,large,player);assert(!bad.ok&&bad.error.original.code=="JourneyViewTextLimit");node->text_key="missing.selected.text";bad=query_interaction_view(w.common,w.interaction,catalog,access,presentation,player);assert(!bad.ok&&bad.error.kind==ErrorKind::internal&&bad.error.original.code=="MissingPresentationText");}
// 仅私有副本里的粮批/名册用于低层报价边界；不会被decode/validate或提交成合法存档。
void supply_edges(const WorldBundle& source,const ArmyRecord& original){WorldBundle w(source);auto* inventory=w.common.state().inventories.find(original.inventory_id);assert(inventory&&!inventory->lots.empty());auto before=checked(preview_army_supply(w.common,w.military,*w.catalog->military,original.id));const auto food=before.food_item_id;auto lot=std::find_if(inventory->lots.begin(),inventory->lots.end(),[&](auto& value){return value.item_id==food&&value.reserved_by.empty()&&value.owner.id==original.organization_id;});assert(lot!=inventory->lots.end());Integer quantity=lot->quantity;lot->reserved_by="controlled.reservation";auto reserved=checked(preview_army_supply(w.common,w.military,*w.catalog->military,original.id));assert(reserved.available==before.available-quantity);auto foreign=*lot;foreign.id="controlled.foreign";foreign.reserved_by="";foreign.owner.id="other.organization";foreign.quantity=999;inventory->lots.push_back(foreign);assert(checked(preview_army_supply(w.common,w.military,*w.catalog->military,original.id)).available==reserved.available);auto broken=w.military;for(auto& army:broken.armies)if(army.id==original.id)army.unit_ids.push_back("controlled.missing.unit");auto bad_read=query_own_army_logistics(w.common,broken,*w.catalog->military,original.commander_actor_id);assert(!bad_read.ok&&bad_read.error.original.code=="ArmyRosterMismatch");auto isolated=w.military;for(auto& army:isolated.armies)if(army.id==original.id){army.member_actor_ids.clear();army.unit_ids.clear();army.prisoner_ids.clear();}auto zero=checked(preview_army_supply(w.common,isolated,*w.catalog->military,original.id));assert(zero.mouth_count==0&&zero.required==0&&zero.full_ticks==0&&zero.shortage==0);auto missing=preview_army_supply(w.common,w.military,*w.catalog->military,"missing.army");assert(!missing.ok&&missing.error.original.code=="UnknownArmy");for(auto& army:isolated.armies)if(army.id==original.id)army.status="closed";auto closed=preview_army_supply(w.common,isolated,*w.catalog->military,original.id);assert(!closed.ok&&closed.error.original.code=="ArmyNotActive");}
}
// 原读取不消耗ID/随机流，且深副本被界面改写后不能污染同一真实世界的下一次查询。
int main(int argc,char** argv){assert(argc==3);const std::string root=argv[2];auto resolve=[&](const std::string& path){return !path.empty()&&path.front()=='/'?path:root+"/"+path;};auto oracle=read_file(argv[1]);Integer cases=0,choices=0,supplies=0;for(auto& row:*oracle.as<BoundaryValue::Array>()){auto source=read_file(resolve(string(row,"state")));auto catalog=checked(prepare_catalog(read_file(resolve(string(row,"catalog"))),source));WorldBundle w(catalog,checked(decode_world_seed(source,*catalog)));require(w.validate());auto before=checked(export_world_state(w));auto checkpoint=checked(encode_world_checkpoint(w));auto player=w.common.state().metadata.player_actor_id;CommonPresentation real(w.common.state(),*catalog->common);ObservedPresentation presentation(real);auto access=w.services.interaction_access();auto encounter=checked(query_journey_encounter(w.common,w.interaction,*catalog->interaction,presentation,player));auto& sidebar=*row.find("sidebar");assert(encounter.travel_active==boundary::get_bool(*sidebar.find("travel"),"active","travel"));auto& expected=*sidebar.find("encounter");assert(bool(encounter.encounter)==!expected.as<BoundaryValue::Dict>()->empty());if(encounter.encounter){assert(encounter.encounter->encounter_id==string(expected,"encounter_id")&&encounter.encounter->provider_actor_id==string(expected,"provider_actor_id")&&encounter.encounter->display_name==string(expected,"display_name"));assert(presentation.names.front()==encounter.encounter->provider_actor_id);}else assert(presentation.names.empty());auto& speaker=*sidebar.find("dialogue_speaker");assert(bool(encounter.dialogue_speaker)==!speaker.as<BoundaryValue::Dict>()->empty());if(encounter.dialogue_speaker)assert(encounter.dialogue_speaker->actor_id==string(speaker,"actor_id")&&encounter.dialogue_speaker->display_name==string(speaker,"display_name"));assert(presentation.names.size()==(encounter.encounter?1u:0u)+(encounter.dialogue_speaker?1u:0u));assert(presentation.texts.empty());auto dialogue=checked(query_interaction_view(w.common,w.interaction,*catalog->interaction,access,presentation,player));dialogue_matches(dialogue,*row.find("dialogue"));if(dialogue.text)*dialogue.text="display-owned edit";if(dialogue.context)dialogue.context->provider_actor_id="display-owned edit";dialogue_matches(checked(query_interaction_view(w.common,w.interaction,*catalog->interaction,access,real,player)),*row.find("dialogue"));assert(checked(query_journey_input_need(w.common,w.personal,w.military,w.interaction,player))==boundary::get_bool(row,"needs_input","oracle"));assert(!checked(query_own_army_logistics(w.common,w.military,*catalog->military,player)));
        for(auto& army:w.military.armies){auto quote=checked(query_own_army_logistics(w.common,w.military,*catalog->military,army.commander_actor_id));assert(quote);auto& expected_quote=*row.find("supplies")->find(army.id);assert(quote->available==integer(expected_quote,"available")&&quote->required==integer(expected_quote,"required")&&quote->mouth_count==integer(expected_quote,"mouth_count")&&quote->full_ticks==integer(expected_quote,"full_ticks")&&quote->shortage==integer(expected_quote,"shortage"));for(auto& id:army.member_actor_ids)if(id!=army.commander_actor_id)assert(!checked(query_own_army_logistics(w.common,w.military,*catalog->military,id)));supply_edges(w,army);++supplies;}
        if(string(*row.find("dialogue"),"phase")=="choice"){choice_edges(w,real);++choices;}
        // 非会面分支不读其它会话或名字；普通对白本身也不等于action_needs_input。
        if(!encounter.encounter){auto hidden=w.interaction;InteractionSession unreachable;unreachable.actor_id=player;unreachable.dialogue_id="unselected.missing";unreachable.node_id="missing";hidden.interactions.push_back(unreachable);ObservedPresentation untouched(real);auto empty=checked(query_journey_encounter(w.common,hidden,*catalog->interaction,untouched,player));assert(!empty.encounter&&!empty.dialogue_speaker&&untouched.names.empty()&&untouched.texts.empty());assert(!checked(query_journey_input_need(w.common,w.personal,w.military,hidden,player)));}
        // 仅本人尚未关闭的真实参战标记需要输入；闭合历史和他人会话不能再触发旧能力拒绝。
        auto participating=w.military;MilitaryBattleRecord battle; battle.id="probe.battle";battle.phase="result";battle.participant_actor_ids={player};participating.battles.push_back(battle);
        assert(checked(query_journey_input_need(w.common,w.personal,participating,w.interaction,player)));
        participating.battles.back().phase="closed";assert(checked(query_journey_input_need(w.common,w.personal,participating,w.interaction,player))==boundary::get_bool(row,"needs_input","oracle"));
        participating.battles.back().phase="planning";participating.battles.back().participant_actor_ids={"unrelated.actor"};assert(checked(query_journey_input_need(w.common,w.personal,participating,w.interaction,player))==boundary::get_bool(row,"needs_input","oracle"));
        exact(before,checked(export_world_state(w)));assert(checkpoint==checked(encode_world_checkpoint(w)));++cases;
    }assert(cases==6&&choices==1&&supplies==2);std::cout<<"background_journey_interaction: PASS (6 original GD read boundaries; scene/say/choice/pending encounter; 2 own-army quotes; hidden options/64-row pages/complete errors/no private peer fields; deep copies and full checkpoint unchanged)\n";}
